%% Sequence: command aktuator + ACK (V3-FR07)
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Admin/Dashboard
    participant API as Flask
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant E as ESP32
    U->>API: POST /api/devices/{id}/control<br/>{actuator, value} + session + CSRF
    API->>DB: cek aktuator sibuk
    alt sibuk
        API-->>U: 409
    else bebas
        API->>DB: INSERT actuator_commands (pending)
        API-->>U: 201 {command}
    end
    E->>API: GET /api/device/devices/{id}/commands<br/>X-Device-Key
    API->>DB: SELECT pending & belum expired
    API->>DB: UPDATE status=delivered
    API-->>E: 200 {commands:[...]}
    E->>E: aktuasi pin GPIO
    E->>API: POST .../commands/{cid}/ack {status}
    API->>DB: UPDATE status=succeeded/failed/timeout
    API-->>E: 200
